Fact fined Identified by actor
Act fine Actor actor Recipient actor' Creates fined(actor') Holds when True
Immunity protected Holder actor Against fine.
?valid fine(Alice, Bob).
+protected(Bob).
?!valid fine(Alice, Bob).
?lawful fine(Alice, Bob).
?valid fine(Bob, Alice).
fine(Alice, Bob).
?!fined(Bob).
fine(Bob, Alice).
?fined(Alice).
